{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b02dd07d045b7041520d27556f47f9cd84573cef1b59d4c6e520416d7afcfd24","ja":"さて、そろそろこのラジオも、\nエンディングが近づいてきちゃったんだけど……。","zh":"那么，这档广播也，\n差不多快到尾声了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1113637a1d8f57c2324089ca3ee84f39f6b4884fea2d8c3fea86ae481951bb5f","ja":"ここで、最後まで聞いてくれたリスナーの\nみんなに、私たちからサプライズだよ！","zh":"在这里，给听到最后的听众\n大家，来自我们的惊喜哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8b8ba83a28c4eab2b290d733dbb9ed0a5a639bb141279a2a637508b14b80ac1b","ja":"なんと、ロコたちの手作りアートを、\nトータル4名様にプレゼントしちゃいます～！","zh":"竟然，ROCO等人的手工作品，\n要送给总共4名啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"af5b2e2904eb03676039b1f58000c95de440dcfa989567a275e03195ea71865d","ja":"ロコからは……ロコアートフォトフレームですっ！\nフレームをイチから作り上げました！","zh":"来自ROCO的是……ROCO艺术相框哦！\n相框是从零开始制作完成的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"33a35a114f26a92024685592a3c8bd75050323c59682817f723adfc3f3a50f5c","ja":"ぜひ、あなたのフォトを飾ってください。\nそのフォトでアートが完成します！","zh":"请务必装饰你的照片。\n用那张照片就能完成艺术画作！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"25d3609702e215a3bd1acd6792889640337ef31d08ba7ca36eaad557edc9b267","ja":"えへへ、私からは……じゃーん！\n……あ、ラジオだから見えないんだった。","zh":"诶嘿嘿，我这边……锵——！\n……啊，因为是广播，看不见呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"970ec7fbb68d6ba49e3727b926b7c8e3e622cefeda4e82ef56b16592cecf528a","ja":"オリジナルTシャツ！　なんと私が染めたんだよ！\n女子力高くピンク！にするつもりだったけど……。","zh":"原创T恤！没想到是我染的哦！\n本来想染成很有女子力的粉色！但是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2254b2d948c7896edc3be09ee476ea8d9d06d4c34461894ece4e938548747764","ja":"やってみたら、赤とか紫も混ざったグラデーションに\nなっちゃって……でも、めちゃくちゃキレイだからね！","zh":"试着做了之后，变成了混有红色和紫色的渐变\n……不过超级漂亮呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e973cd3f2a7feeaba349f26fc6cd5385fbfcd9bafaab65c99aafc5d501ecc500","ja":"うふふ。次は私の番ね。\n私は～……アロマキャンドルを手作りしてみました～。","zh":"呵呵。接下来轮到我了吧。\n我～……试着亲手做了香薰蜡烛～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6e58de775449fcdb004d06b29b8fde76cc0d5a0d46303247651f06c9c483ac42","ja":"静かな夜のお供になればと思って。香りと灯りに、\nほっと一息ついてもらえると嬉しいです～。","zh":"想着能陪伴你度过宁静的夜晚。伴着香气与灯光，\n能让你松一口气的话我会很开心～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"bbb846f96e390d134df9b76c4bbcc66d232c0e24efeff898b87efb076b17dc1d","ja":"わたしは、工房でオルゴールを作ってきました♪\nヴァイオリンの形をしてるんですよ。","zh":"我在工坊做了一个音乐盒♪\n是小提琴形状的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e2ee31da548ff4f9a488729c6ea7f32093cd32d1a14de758d50fea9ee8ce84a5","ja":"飾っても可愛いですし、優しい音色もするので、\nずっと聞いていられると思います。","zh":"作为装饰也很可爱，音色又温柔，\n感觉可以一直听下去。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d42b4e3bb59b5cb6f44da5b651cb2626da2084b8d71c5def6476c441210f61f6","ja":"詳しい応募方法などは、ラジオの公式HPを\nチェックしてください！","zh":"详细的报名方法等，请查看广播的官方网站\n请查看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_962.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"52490ca21665fac5e482c6f7eeb521ea77fed93f0986f93ae73f38fa88c0b1c8","ja":"私たちからのお知らせは以上です。それでは……\nラジオにお招きいただき、ありがとうございました～。","zh":"以上就是我们的通知。那么……\n感谢您邀请我们来到电台～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
